      "explanation": "The diff replaces parameterized queries and safe identifier quoting (psycopg2.sql.SQL/Identifier) with direct string formatting (str.format) for user-controlled inputs like db_name, db_user, db_username, and db_pwd. This allows an attacker to inject arbitrary SQL commands (e.g., via a username containing a quote or semicolon).",
