      "suggested_fix": "Revert to using psycopg2.sql.SQL and psycopg2.sql.Identifier for identifiers, and use parameterized queries (%s) for values like passwords. Ensure all user inputs are strictly validated against an allowlist of valid identifiers if string formatting is absolutely necessary, but parameterization is the preferred secure method.",
